        {
          "id": 1356410729,
          "type": null,
          "body": "`epan/dissectors/packet-spnego.c` is a generated file, so `epan/dissectors/asn1/ilp.cnf`epan/dissectors/asn1/spnego/packet-spnego-template.c1 needed to be changed (and `epan/dissectors/packet-spnego.c` then regenerated from the changed source), rather than being edited directly.\n\nFixed in !10353.",
